    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In Coin Smith, you\u2019ll:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the golden coin to generate wealth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build structures like the <strong>Blacksmith Hammer</strong>, <strong>Coin Garden</strong>, and <strong>Lydian Caravan</strong> to automate your coin production.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically upgrade your assets to maximize profits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reset  your progress to gain prestige level for permanent bonuses, unlocking new layers of progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Addictive Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a simple click and grow your empire into a sprawling network of automated wealth generation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Structures and Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a variety of visually distinct structures, such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blacksmith Hammer</strong>: Your humble beginning, forging the first coins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lydian Caravan</strong>: Expanding your wealth through trade.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Galactic Smelter</strong>: Reach for the stars and turn asteroids into coins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pixel Art Charm</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a retro-styled world brought to life with detailed pixel art. Every structure you build is a visual delight, from glowing forge flames to mystical gardens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prestige and Replayability</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reset your progress to unlock permanent bonuses and discover new layers of depth. With each prestige, your path to riches becomes faster and more rewarding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why Play Coin Smith?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a seasoned clicker fan or new to the genre, <strong>Coin Smith</strong> offers a blend of simplicity, strategy, and charm. This is the game that keeps you coming back for more.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In Coin Smith, you\u2019ll:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the golden coin to generate wealth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build structures like the <strong>Blacksmith Hammer</strong>, <strong>Coin Garden</strong>, and <strong>Lydian Caravan</strong> to automate your coin production.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically upgrade your assets to maximize profits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reset  your progress to gain prestige level for permanent bonuses, unlocking new layers of progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Addictive Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a simple click and grow your empire into a sprawling network of automated wealth generation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Structures and Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a variety of visually distinct structures, such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blacksmith Hammer</strong>: Your humble beginning, forging the first coins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lydian Caravan</strong>: Expanding your wealth through trade.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Galactic Smelter</strong>: Reach for the stars and turn asteroids into coins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pixel Art Charm</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a retro-styled world brought to life with detailed pixel art. Every structure you build is a visual delight, from glowing forge flames to mystical gardens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prestige and Replayability</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reset your progress to unlock permanent bonuses and discover new layers of depth. With each prestige, your path to riches becomes faster and more rewarding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why Play Coin Smith?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a seasoned clicker fan or new to the genre, <strong>Coin Smith</strong> offers a blend of simplicity, strategy, and charm. This is the game that keeps you coming back for more.</p>",
    "short_description": "Welcome to Coin Smith, an addictive idle clicker game where your journey to unimaginable riches starts with a single tap. Set in a world inspired by the ancient Lydian Empire, the birthplace of coins, you'll build, upgrade, and strategize your way to wealth and glory.",
